  "steps": [
    "Potatoes. Heat oil in a large skillet over medium heat. Cook the potatoes 8–10 minutes until fork tender and slightly crispy; set aside.",
    "Onion. In the same skillet, cook the onion 2–3 minutes until soft.",
    "Beef. Add the beef and let it brown undisturbed like a smash burger, then break it up and cook through. Add green chilis and seasonings.",
    "Combine. Return the potatoes, stir, then lay cheese over the top and let it melt 1–2 minutes.",
    "Sauce. Whisk the sauce ingredients and drizzle over, or serve on the side, with your toppings."
